fixture a_repress_breaks_the_charge_hold
doc docs/adr/0013, the Charged strike: "Holding attack on, unbroken, for 24 frames" (task 6 review, L1): attack let go and pressed again inside one tick (frame 20) starts a new hold, so the release on 31 asks for nothing.
room test/flat
frames 60
input
  0..19 attack
  20 attack !attack
  21..30 attack
end
expect
  at 20 event.attack=1
  never 0..59 event.charge_release=1
  never 0..59 action=charged
end
